# Grade 4 Maths: Number Town · Market Square (ages 9–11). 12 lessons.
# Each lesson: key, title, the building it opens (part), topic icon and colour, home-card text, done text,
# step labels, board steps (lines, narration, cues: one cue phrase per board line, in order),
# hand-written questions (text, picture, step, (right, why), (wrong, why), (wrong, why)) and flashcards.
# tools/build_maths_g4.py turns this into tools/maths_g4_data.js, records the narration and adds the town buildings.

def Q(text, pic, step, *opts):
    return dict(text=text, pic=pic, step=step, opts=list(opts))

